{
    "background_story": "In the ancient lore of the celestial realms, Wynter was a powerful being known as a Prajapati, a lord of creation. Born from the cosmic waters, Wynter possessed the essence of the universe and wielded the power to shape reality. With a mere thought, Wynter could bring forth entire galaxies, summoning stars and planets into existence. As a guardian of the cosmos, Wynter ensured the balance of the universe, maintaining harmony among the celestial bodies. The Prajapati's wisdom and benevolence earned the reverence of the gods themselves, who sought Wynter's counsel in times of turmoil. Wynter's creations were said to be infused with the essence of the divine, and those who sought to understand the mysteries of the universe would often seek out the wisdom of this powerful Prajapati.",
